<section class="page-body"><div class="container foundation-index"><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">MODULE 02 · CHAPTER 02 · CHECKPOINT · ABOUT 30 MIN</span><h3>T/N/H hiragana — mixed checkpoint</h3><p>Review fifteen kana, sound exceptions, look-alike shapes, printed labels and two licensed conversations in sixteen scored questions.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-02/chapter-02/checkpoint/">Take T/N/H checkpoint ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">HIRAGANA I · CHAPTER 03 · LESSON 01 · ABOUT 24 MIN</span><h3>Meet the final basic hiragana cards</h3><p>Sort the remaining M/Y/R/W kana, recognize わ, を and ん, and check eight written answers.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-02/chapter-03/lesson-01/" aria-label="Study Hiragana I Chapter 03 lesson 01">Study Hiragana I Chapter 03 lesson 01 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">MODULE 02 · CHAPTER 03 · LESSON 03 · ABOUT 26 MIN</span><h3>The nasal ん and object marker を</h3><p>Count independent nasal morae and distinguish the object particle を from vowel kana お in ten written checks.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-02/chapter-03/lesson-03/">Study Hiragana I Chapter 03 lesson 03 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">MODULE 02 · CHAPTER 03 · LESSON 04 · ABOUT 32 MIN</span><h3>Recognize and type M/Y/R/W hiragana</h3><p>Type sixteen remaining basic kana and six picture labels, then self-review optional drafts.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-02/chapter-03/lesson-04/" aria-label="Study Hiragana I Chapter 03 lesson 04">Study Hiragana I Chapter 03 lesson 04 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">MODULE 02 · CHAPTER 03 · LESSON 05 · ABOUT 27 MIN</span><h3>Read the picture labels — M/Y/R/W hiragana</h3><p>Find ten original picture labels and two printed notices, then cite evidence in twelve reading questions.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-02/chapter-03/lesson-05/" aria-label="Study Hiragana I Chapter 03 lesson 05">Study Hiragana I Chapter 03 lesson 05 ↗</a></div><div class="available-lesson"><div><span class="eyebrow">MODULE 02 · CHAPTER 03 · LESSON 06 · ABOUT 25 MIN</span><h3>Hear M/Y/R/W words in two everyday conversations</h3><p>Listen to a fruit-shop request and classroom instructions, then answer six spoken-comprehension questions with transcript review.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/module-02/chapter-03/lesson-06/" aria-label="Study Hiragana I Chapter 03 lesson 06">Study Hiragana I Chapter 03 lesson 06 ↗</a></div></div></section>
